John 4:1 , Christ talks with a woman of Samaria, and reveals himself unto her;
John 4:27 , His disciples marvel;
John 4:31 , He declares to them his zeal for God's glory;
John 4:39 , Many Samaritans believe on him;
John 4:43 , He departs into Galilee, and heals the ruler's son that lay sick at Capernaum.
